AI Usage Statement

In this assignment, artificial intelligence was used to assist with the overall system architecture design, implementation guidance, and testing process. During development, I consulted AI when encountering unclear technical concepts or implementation difficulties. The AI provided reference code examples and structural suggestions. Based on these references, I independently understood, modified, adjusted, and completed the final program code.

With the support of AI-assisted debugging and test case suggestions, the testing procedure became more comprehensive and systematic. The final program runs correctly and stably. All core logic, code modification decisions, and final optimisation were completed by myself.